# Paths baselinefit skips when scanning its own repository.
#
# This file uses gitignore syntax and is read from any directory being scanned,
# so you can drop one into your own project too.
#
# The data files below quote, by design, every pattern baselinefit looks for.
# Scanning them reports the catalog rather than any real code.
src/features.json
tools/detectors.json

# The documentation shows example findings and example output.
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md

# The demo site is deliberately full of findings; the test suite scans it.
tests/fixtures/
